@startuml sequence-salon-onboarding
title Quy trình Onboarding Doanh nghiệp Salon & Phê duyệt Pháp lý (Salon Onboarding)
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam participantPadding 10
skinparam boxPadding 10

actor "Chủ Salon\n(Business Owner)" as Owner
participant "Giao diện Web\n(Salon Portal)" as Web
participant "MediaController\n(Upload Gateway)" as MediaController
participant "BusinessController" as BizController
participant "BusinessOnboardingService" as BizService
database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma ORM)" as DB
actor "Quản trị viên Nền tảng\n(Platform Admin)" as Admin
participant "AdminController" as AdminController

== 1. Chủ Salon Khởi tạo Hồ sơ Doanh nghiệp ==
Owner -> Web : Nhập thông tin doanh nghiệp (Tên cty, Mã số thuế, Tên thương hiệu, Địa chỉ)
Web -> BizController : POST /api/v1/business/onboarding/draft\nBody: { companyName, taxCode, name, slug, addressLine, ... }
activate BizController
BizController -> BizService : saveDraft(userId, draftInput)
activate BizService
BizService -> DB : prisma.business.upsert({\n  where: { ownerProfile: { userId } },\n  data: { status: 'DRAFT', name, taxCode, ... }\n})
activate DB
DB --> BizService : Business draft record (id, status: 'DRAFT')
deactivate DB
BizService --> BizController : Draft saved
deactivate BizService
BizController --> Web : 200 OK (status: 'DRAFT')
deactivate BizController

== 2. Tải lên Hồ sơ Pháp lý (Media Upload) ==
Owner -> Web : Đính kèm file Giấy phép kinh doanh, CCCD chủ cơ sở, Giấy tờ thuế
Web -> MediaController : POST /api/v1/media/upload (multipart/form-data)\nBody: { file, category: 'LEGAL_DOCUMENT' }
activate MediaController
MediaController -> DB : prisma.mediaFile.create({\n  uploaderId: userId, filename, mimeType, path, visibility: 'PRIVATE'\n})
activate DB
DB --> MediaController : mediaFile record (id, url: '/api/v1/media/{id}')
deactivate DB
MediaController --> Web : 201 Created (mediaId, url)
deactivate MediaController

Web -> BizController : POST /api/v1/business/onboarding/draft\nBody: { legalDocuments: [{ documentType: 'BUSINESS_LICENSE', mediaId, ... }] }
activate BizController
BizController -> BizService : saveDraft(userId, { legalDocuments })
activate BizService
BizService -> DB : prisma.businessDocumentVersion.createMany(...)
activate DB
DB --> BizService : Document versions attached
deactivate DB
BizService --> BizController : Updated draft
deactivate BizService
BizController --> Web : 200 OK
deactivate BizController

== 3. Nộp Hồ sơ để Chờ Xét duyệt ==
Owner -> Web : Bấm "Gửi hồ sơ xét duyệt" (Submit Onboarding)
Web -> BizController : POST /api/v1/business/onboarding/submit
activate BizController
BizController -> BizService : submit(userId)
activate BizService
BizService -> BizService : validateSubmissionRequirements(draft):\n- Đủ thông tin thuế, CCCD, GPKD\n- Ít nhất 1 chi nhánh khởi tạo
BizService -> DB : prisma.business.update({\n  where: { id },\n  data: { status: 'PENDING_REVIEW', submittedAt: now }\n})\n+ prisma.documentReviewEvent.create({ action: 'SUBMIT' })
activate DB
DB --> BizService : Business status: PENDING_REVIEW
deactivate DB
BizService --> BizController : Submitted successfully
deactivate BizService
BizController --> Web : 200 OK (status: 'PENDING_REVIEW')
deactivate BizController

== 4. Quản trị viên Nền tảng Thẩm định & Phê duyệt ==
Admin -> AdminController : GET /api/v1/admin/onboarding/pending
activate AdminController
AdminController -> DB : prisma.business.findMany({ where: { status: 'PENDING_REVIEW' } })
activate DB
DB --> AdminController : Danh sách doanh nghiệp chờ duyệt
deactivate DB
AdminController --> Admin : Hiển thị danh sách hồ sơ cần thẩm định
deactivate AdminController

Admin -> AdminController : PATCH /api/v1/admin/onboarding/{id}/approve\nBody: { note: "Hồ sơ pháp lý hợp lệ và đầy đủ" }
activate AdminController
AdminController -> BizService : approveBusiness(businessId, adminUser, note)
activate BizService
BizService -> DB : prisma.$transaction(async (tx) => {\n  tx.business.update({ status: 'APPROVED' }),\n  tx.branch.updateMany({ where: { businessId }, data: { status: 'ACTIVE' } }),\n  tx.businessReviewEvent.create({ action: 'APPROVE', actorId: admin.id }),\n  tx.auditLog.create({ action: 'UPDATE', entityType: 'Business' }),\n  tx.notificationOutbox.create({ type: 'SALON_ONBOARDING_APPROVED', recipient: ownerId })\n})
activate DB
DB --> BizService : Transaction commit thành công
deactivate DB
BizService --> AdminController : Business approved & Branch activated
deactivate BizService
AdminController --> Admin : 200 OK (Phê duyệt thành công)
deactivate AdminController

Web -> BizController : GET /api/v1/business/my-onboarding
activate BizController
BizController --> Web : 200 OK (status: 'APPROVED')
deactivate BizController
Web --> Owner : Mở khóa toàn bộ tính năng vận hành Salon Portal & Hiển thị trên Marketplace!

@enduml
